      "hasMediaInOriginal": false,
      "fallbackReason": null,
      "text": "15 September 2026 Current Affairs in Hindi & English\n\n➼ 18वें BRICS Summit में सदस्य देशों के बीच महामारी के खतरों की निगरानी और उनसे निपटने के लिए BRICS Integrated Early Warning System की घोषणा की गई।\nThe BRICS Integrated Early Warning System was announced at the 18th BRICS Summit to monitor and respond to epidemic threats among member countries.\n\n➼ सितंबर 2026 में चौथा Indo-German Environment Forum “Together For More Resilience” थीम के तहत आयोजित किया गया।\nThe 4th Indo-German Environment Forum was held under the theme “Together For More Resilience.”\n\n➼ भारत ने श्रीलंका को हराकर Women’s Asia Cup Cricket 2026 का खिताब जीता।\nIndia won the Women’s Asia Cup Cricket 2026 title by defeating Sri Lanka.\n\n➼ भारत ने दक्षिण कोरिया को 4-1 से हराकर Men’s Junior Asia Cup Hockey 2026 का खिताब जीता।\nIndia defeated South Korea 4-1 to win the Men’s Junior Asia Cup Hockey 2026 title.\n\n➼ भारत ने चीन को 1-0 से हराकर Women’s Junior Asia Cup Hockey 2026 का खिताब जीता।\nIndia defeated China 1-0 to win the Women’s Junior Asia Cup Hockey 2026 title.\n\n➼ बेंगलुरु में आयोजित Tech Mahindra Global Chess League (GCL) का खिताब Ganges Grandmasters ने जीता।\nGanges Grandmasters won the Tech Mahindra Global Chess League (GCL) title held in Bengaluru.\n\n➼ Elena Rybakina (Kazakhstan) ने US Open Tennis Championships 2026 में महिला एकल का खिताब जीता।\nElena Rybakina of Kazakhstan won the Women’s Singles title at the US Open Tennis Championships 2026.\n\n➼ भारतीय तीरंदाज B. Dhiraj (Dhiraj Bommadevara) ने Saltillo, Mexico में Archery World Cup Final के पुरुष रिकर्व वर्ग में ऐतिहासिक स्वर्ण पदक जीता।\nIndian archer B. Dhiraj (Dhiraj Bommadevara) won a historic gold medal in the men’s recurve category at the Archery World Cup Final in Saltillo, Mexico.\n\n➼ Kimi Antonelli (Mercedes) ने Spanish Grand Prix 2026 का खिताब जीता।\nKimi Antonelli (Mercedes) won the Spanish Grand Prix 2026 title.\n\n➼ Aichi-Nagoya, Japan में 19 सितंबर से 4 अक्टूबर 2026 तक 20वें Asian Games आयोजित किए जाएंगे।\nThe 20th Asian Games will be held in Aichi-Nagoya, Japan, from September 19 to October 4, 2026.\n\n➼ “Woman Unknown” ने 83वें Venice International Film Festival में प्रतिष्ठित Golden Lion (Best Film) पुरस्कार जीता।\n“Woman Unknown” won the prestigious Golden Lion (Best Film) award at the 83rd Venice International Film Festival.\n\n➼ John Malkovich ने 83वें Venice International Film Festival में Best Actor – Volpi Cup पुरस्कार जीता।\nJohn Malkovich won the Volpi Cup for Best Actor at the 83rd Venice International Film Festival.\n\n➼ Malaysia के Prime Minister Anwar Ibrahim को Sheikh Aboobacker Foundation द्वारा स्थापित पहला ‘Excellence Award’ प्रदान किया गया।\nMalaysia’s Prime Minister Anwar Ibrahim received the first ‘Excellence Award’ instituted by the Sheikh Aboobacker Foundation.\n\n➼ Raigarh, Chhattisgarh में Jindal Steel और CSIR-CRRI द्वारा steel slag से 1.85 km लंबी, चार-लेन सड़क बनाई गई है।\nA 1.85-km, four-lane road has been constructed from steel slag by Jindal Steel and CSIR-CRRI in Raigarh, Chhattisgarh.\n\n➼ Beijing में World Humanoid Robot Games में TianGong Ultra humanoid robot ने 100-metre sprint में 8.64 seconds का रिकॉर्ड समय दर्ज किया।\nThe humanoid robot TianGong Ultra clocked a record time of 8.64 seconds in the 100-metre sprint at the World Humanoid Robot Games in Beijing.",
